---
import { ArrowLeft, Coins, Dices, RotateCcw, Sparkles, Trophy } from 'lucide-astro';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="2142万分之一 · 白子诩" description="大乐透头奖概率 1/21,425,712，每注 2 元。自定义购买计划，批量模拟 N 个平行世界，看看投入与回报。">
  <main class="lottery-page">
    <div class="section-wrap lottery-inner">
      <a class="back-link" href="/games/lottery-reincarnation/"><ArrowLeft /> 返回游戏介绍</a>
      <header class="lottery-header">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">GAME LAB / LOTTERY PROBABILITY</p><h1>2142万<br /><em>分之一</em></h1><p>大乐透头奖概率 <strong>1 / 21,425,712</strong>，每注 <strong>2 元</strong>，每周开奖 3 期。设定你的购买计划，批量模拟 N 个平行世界，看看投入与回报。</p></div>
        <div class="lottery-contract"><span>THE CONTRACT</span><strong>1 / 21,425,712</strong><small>头奖概率 · 2 元/注 · 每周 3 期</small></div>
      </header>

      <section class="lottery-simulator" aria-labelledby="lottery-title">
        <form class="lottery-settings" id="lottery-settings">
          <p class="eyebrow">PURCHASE PLAN</p>
          <h2 id="lottery-title">设定你的购买计划</h2>

          <div class="lottery-field">
            <span class="lottery-label">购买年龄</span>
            <div class="lottery-input-row">
              <label>从 <input id="lottery-start-age" type="number" min="1" max="120" value="30" inputmode="numeric" /> 岁</label>
              <label>到 <input id="lottery-end-age" type="number" min="1" max="120" value="50" inputmode="numeric" /> 岁</label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="lottery-field">
            <span class="lottery-label">每周购买次数</span>
            <div class="lottery-frequency" id="lottery-frequency-group" role="group" aria-label="每周购买次数">
              <button type="button" data-frequency="1" class="active">1 次</button>
              <button type="button" data-frequency="2">2 次</button>
              <button type="button" data-frequency="3">3 次</button>
            </div>
            <small>大乐透每周开奖 3 期，选择每周买几次</small>
          </div>

          <div class="lottery-field">
            <span class="lottery-label">每次购买注数</span>
            <input id="lottery-tickets" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="1" inputmode="numeric" />
            <small>每次买几注 · 每注 2 元</small>
          </div>

          <div class="lottery-field">
            <span class="lottery-label">平行世界数</span>
            <div class="lottery-presets" role="group" aria-label="平行世界数量">
              <button type="button" data-worlds="1">1</button>
              <button type="button" data-worlds="100">100</button>
              <button type="button" data-worlds="1000">1,000</button>
              <button type="button" data-worlds="10000">10,000</button>
            </div>
            <div class="lottery-input-row"><label>自定义 <input id="lottery-worlds" type="number" min="1" max="100000" value="100" inputmode="numeric" /> 个世界</label></div>
            <small>点数字选中世界数，再点“开始模拟”运行</small>
          </div>

          <button class="lottery-live" id="lottery-run" type="submit"><Dices /> 开始模拟</button>
          <button class="lottery-reset" id="lottery-reset" type="button"><RotateCcw /> 重置累计</button>
        </form>

        <div class="lottery-stage">
          <div class="lottery-plan">
            <p class="eyebrow">ONE LIFETIME</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>购买次数</dt><dd id="plan-purchases">—</dd></div>
              <div><dt>购买注数</dt><dd id="plan-tickets">—</dd></div>
              <div><dt>一生投入</dt><dd id="plan-cost">—</dd></div>
              <div><dt>头奖金额</dt><dd>1,000 万</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
          <div class="lottery-progress-block">
            <div class="lottery-life-head"><span id="lottery-progress-label">等待模拟</span><span class="mono" id="lottery-progress-value">0%</span></div>
            <div class="lottery-progress-track"><span id="lottery-progress-bar"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="lottery-running" id="lottery-running" hidden aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="lottery-balls"><span>07</span><span>14</span><span>23</span><span>31</span><span>35</span></div>
            <p class="mono" id="lottery-rolling">已模拟 0 个世界</p>
          </div>
          <p class="lottery-status" id="lottery-status">设定购买计划后开始模拟，每个世界都严格按计划买完一辈子。</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lottery-results" id="lottery-results" hidden aria-live="polite">
        <div class="lottery-result-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SIMULATION RESULT</p><h2>平行世界报告</h2></div><span id="lottery-result-summary">—</span></div>
        <div class="lottery-result-grid">
          <article><span>模拟世界</span><strong id="result-worlds">—</strong><small>个平行世界</small></article>
          <article><span>总投入</span><strong id="result-invested">—</strong><small>N 世 × 每世成本</small></article>
          <article class="lottery-gold"><span>中头奖</span><strong id="result-winners">—</strong><small>命中头奖的世界数</small></article>
          <article class="lottery-gold"><span>总奖金</span><strong id="result-won">—</strong><small>中奖数 × 头奖</small></article>
          <article class="lottery-net"><span>净收益</span><strong id="result-net">—</strong><small>奖金 − 投入</small></article>
          <article><span>回收率</span><strong id="result-rate">—</strong><small>奖金 ÷ 投入</small></article>
        </div>
        <div class="lottery-winners" id="lottery-winners" hidden>
          <div class="lottery-block-head"><span class="eyebrow">JACKPOT WORLDS</span><span>中奖世界明细</span></div>
          <p id="lottery-winners-text">—</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lottery-total">
        <div class="lottery-block-head"><span class="eyebrow">CUMULATIVE</span><span>累计统计 · 保存在本地</span></div>
        <dl class="lottery-stat-list">
          <div><dt>累计模拟世界</dt><dd id="total-worlds">0</dd></div>
          <div><dt>累计投入</dt><dd id="total-invested">0 元</dd></div>
          <div><dt>累计中奖</dt><dd id="total-wins">0 次</dd></div>
          <div><dt>累计奖金</dt><dd id="total-won">0 元</dd></div>
          <div><dt>累计净收益</dt><dd id="total-net">0 元</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <ol class="lottery-run-log" id="lottery-run-log"></ol>
      </section>

      <section class="lottery-explanation">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">THE MATH</p><h2>小概率，<br /><em>经不起无限重复。</em></h2></div>
        <div><p>以默认计划（30—50 岁、每周买 1 次、每次 1 注）计算：一辈子买 1,040 次、1,040 注，投入 <strong>2,080 元</strong>；一辈子不中头奖的概率约 <strong>99.9951%</strong>。</p><p>单看期望：每世投入 2,080 元，头奖固定 1,000 万，期望收益约 485 元，长期回收率约 23%——<strong>依然会亏掉七成以上</strong>。平行世界越多，结果越接近这个数学期望。</p><p>模拟对每一注独立判定，不做近似。平行世界数支持 1—100,000，大数量分块执行并实时显示进度。</p></div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <canvas class="lottery-canvas" id="lottery-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="lottery-win" id="lottery-win" hidden>
      <div class="lottery-win-card">
        <Trophy class="lottery-win-trophy" aria-hidden="true" />
        <p class="eyebrow">JACKPOT</p>
        <h2 id="lottery-win-title">中奖了！</h2>
        <p id="lottery-win-meta">—</p>
        <button class="lottery-win-again" id="lottery-win-close" type="button"><Sparkles /> 继续模拟</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
<script src="../../../../scripts/pages/lottery-reincarnation.ts"></script>
